1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:00,794
Wait.

2
00:00:00,794 --> 00:00:07,044
We usually think things happen on their own when they release energy, like a ball rolling downhill.

3
00:00:07,044 --> 00:00:13,372
This one sucks energy in from its surroundings, and still goes, all by itself.

4
00:00:13,372 --> 00:00:14,114
Why?

5
00:00:14,114 --> 00:00:17,278
Energy alone cannot be the whole story.

6
00:00:17,278 --> 00:00:22,760
By the end of this lesson you will know the second driving force of all chemistry.

